	 NOP		/PREVENT FROM SKIP
	TAD I EMUINST	/THE INSTRUCTION AGAIN
	CLL RTL
	RTL		/INDIRECT-BIT TO LINK.
	CLA
	TAD I EMUFLD
	SNL		/INDIRECT OR DIRECT ?
	 JMP EMDIR	/DIRECT.
	RTL
	RAL		/THIS TIME WE NEED THE DATAFIELD
EMDIR,	AND C70
	TAD C6201	/CDF USERS INSTR./DATAFIELD
	DCA MRIFLD	/WE HAVE CORRECT FIELD IN MRIFLD
	TAD I EMUINST	/AND ADDRESS IN ZTEM1
	AND C7000
	TAD (400+ZTEM1	/MAKE INDIRECT INSTRUCTION.
EMSELF,	DCA MRINST	/WE ALSO COME HERE FOR OPR'S
